00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.360
but one by one their Digimon were defeated even after they Digivolved. Then

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.220
Takato and Grawlmon went to this alternate universe. Takato figured out his

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:25.060
only chance to defeat Mihiromon was to believe in himself and use the blue card

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:29.560
to make Grawlmon Matrix Digivolve toward Grawlmon. He took the title by the tail and

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:29.960
Save the-

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.290
day.

